	(text "DRAFT / NOT FOR ORDER / NO FIRE\nSTANDALONE TFT POWER REVIEW - NOT CONNECTED TO ROOT PCB\nExternal test supply: +5V_CARRIER 4.75..5.25V and GND; PWR_FLAG declares this external source ONLY.\nTFT load 0..0.4A is a design assumption, not measured module current.\nC301/C302: 10uF each,25V,X5R,0805; C304:47uF,16V,X5R,1210.\nCeff/DC bias,thermal,PG/EN ramp,SPI backfeed,layout and full5V budget NOT qualified.\nPG is diagnostic open-drain, NOT an approved GPIO assignment or safety enable.\nKelvin VOS at C304+; VIN caps at VIN/PGND; AGND/PGND/EP single point.\nNo main SCH/PCB edits. General routing and firmware HOLD remain.\nDo not import automatically: project ref collision / footprints must be reviewed."
	(at 101.6 149.86 0)
